    "body": "@domenic No worries, I think I've done that now. I read the thing saying *\"...I represent that I do not work in the field of web technologies...\"* as preventing my signing as an individual, but delving in a couple of clicks I see [the definition](https://whatwg.org/ipr-policy#210-field-of-web-technologies) is people **creating** web technologies. But for belt & braces, I've also ensured `tjcrowder` and `farsightsoftware` are public members of the org (they'd defaulted to private), so we should be covered one way or another.",
